">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁OceanBase发布湖库一体AI数据平台OceanLake并开源核心引擎</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4c6a872491ca9692a1f5c1e9fd96de5c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">11月24日，蚂蚁OceanBase正式发布面向AI时代的战略产品——湖库一体AI数据平台OceanLake，并宣布开源其核心引擎AI数据库（项目代号OceanSeek）。OceanLake采用湖库一体架构，统一管理结构化、半结构化及非结构化等多模态数据，通过将数据与业务语义关联，为Agent提供实时业务上下文，支持从开发验证到规模化应用。该平台坚持“湖库一体、多模融合、Agent友好、开源开放”四大原则，旨在解决企业智能化转型中私有数据挖掘、多模态数据利用及数据治理等难题。目前，OceanLake已在蚂蚁灵光、平安寿险及厦门航空等场景落地，显著提升了模型评测效率与数据交付速度。OceanBase CEO杨冰表示，此次发布标志着数据库核心能力向多模态一致性、AI生产可靠性及实时Agent决策演进，通过开源持续降</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达董事会一致投票恢复黄仁勋总裁及CEO职务，股价应声大涨31%</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bed78301d8259252ffea81705af96e3a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">NVIDIA董事会近日投票一致通过，正式恢复黄仁勋的总裁、CEO及董事职务，结束了此前一周的权力拉锯。此前，董事长哈维·琼斯曾明确表示无意让其回归，此次反转主要得益于三方背书：董事会对黄仁勋的坦诚表示满意，美国政府高层确认其回归不构成国家安全风险，且总统特朗普公开表态支持。受此消息影响，英伟达股价应声大涨31%。黄仁勋在重返总部后表示，将致力于成为更好的CEO。作为全球市值最高的AI芯片巨头，此次管理层变动的平息标志着英伟达重新回到创始人掌舵时代，资本市场对此给予了积极反馈，消除了此前因权力更迭带来的不确定性风险。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">商汤开源SenseNova U1.6模型，首次赋予8B模型原生图像自修正能力</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3eabceafb469d332ba0c01de640efa18.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">商汤科技正式发布并开源SenseNova U1.6原生多模态模型，首次为8B量级模型引入“原生图像自修正”能力。该模型通过“生成-反思-修正”的闭环机制，模拟人类设计师工作流，自动识别并修复文字乱码、排版崩坏及光影逻辑错误，显著降低复杂场景下的废片率。在UltraTextBench密集信息图测试中，开启自修正功能后得分从86.04提升至92.28。针对文字生成难题，模型引入“信息图美学模型”，支持高质量图文海报一次性生成。目前，SenseNova U1.6已全面开放模型权重，并正式上线ComfyUI，支持开发者在节点式工作流中直接调用。此次更新标志着AI绘图从“单向生成”向“闭环质检”的工业化阶段演进，为AI内容生成提供了更可控的生产力路径。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与思科联合开源Shirudo项目，实现AI智能体动态eBPF系统防护</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/40228632a3893ece841b3cb4f05c2fbb.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI与思科于11月24日正式开源Linux运行时环境项目Shirudo，旨在为AI智能体系统提供无需停机的实时安全防护。该方案核心利用Linux内核的eBPF技术，允许AI智能体在不修改内核或重启系统的前提下，动态注入安全防护规则。在系统漏洞爆发至补丁落地的真空期内，Shirudo能通过AI即时生成的防护策略抵御攻击，保障业务负载持续运行。OpenAI表示，该项目是迈向自主防御基础设施的关键一步，通过AI智能体定位受影响系统、测试并共享防护策略，协助安全人员争取补丁部署的时间窗口。Shirudo的推出为服务器提供了自适应的新型威胁防御能力，实现了人类安全专家与AI智能体的协同防御模式。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">MiniMax H3开源百日生态报告：衍生模型达1472个，下载量破1.48亿次</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/51af869466e3890a8cd7f0bce422ad7f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">MiniMax近日发布H3开源百日生态成绩单，宣布其基座模型已裂变出1472个衍生模型，累计下载量突破1.48亿次，平均每秒下载超17次。H3Family目前包含H3、H3-Highspeed、H3-Lite、H3-Image及H3-Image Highspeed五款旗舰模型，覆盖从2K画质创作到极致性价比试错等多元需求。生态繁荣得益于开发者与企业的深度参与，英伟达、腾讯、阿里及Suno、HeyGen、Pika等头部平台均基于H3进行再训练或授权合作，应用场景已渗透至电商、游戏、影视及工业设计等领域。垂类扩展模型表现亮眼，如fal的H3Max优化了生成速度，Suno的H3Move专注于对口型MV制作，Akatz Labs的Character Swap则实现了精准角色替换。MiniMax表示将持续开源，通过开放生</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
